s expected big payday with Anthropic IPO, and Nintendo's big week with Zelda","summary":"Deirdre Bosa discusses Anthropic's (ANTH.PVT) oversubscribed IPO, how Jensen Huang's stance on China has evolved over the years, and Nintendo's (NTDOY) The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time, which has sold over 5 million copies.\n\nDeirdre Bosa then sits down with Hugging Face Co-Founder Thomas Wolf to talk about the company's best month in October, on controlling AI, and open-source models.\n\n'Deirdre Bosa Live' airs every day at 4 p.m. Tune in daily to hear how the latest developments in AI and technology are reshaping companies, industries, and the global economy.","publisher":"Yahoo Finance Video","date":"2026-11-11T22:29:11Z","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/big-techs-expected-big-payday-with-anthropic-ipo-and-nintendos-big-week-with-zelda-222911332.html"},{"title":"Anthropic IPO eyes higher valuation as stronger demand pushes price up","summary":"The 8:30 hosts, Julie Hyman, Pras Subramanian, and Jake Conley, discuss Anthropic's (ANTH.PVT) IPO, which is drawing heavier demand, with bankers weighing a higher share price and valuation than initially announced.","publisher":"Yahoo Finance Video","date":"2026-11-11T14:55:20Z","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/anthropic-ipo-eyes-higher-valuation-as-stronger-demand-pushes-price-up-145520633.html"},{"title":"Rocket Lab CEO Says It Could Be ‘Extremely Profitable’ Without Neutron — But SpaceX Is Not The Only Reason It’s Building The Rocket","summary":"Even if SpaceX launches for less, Beck wants to reserve half of Neutron’s capacity over time for Rocket Lab’s own missions.","publisher":"Stocktwits","date":"2026-11-12T01:44:45Z","url":"https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/rocketlab-ceo-extremely-profitable-without-neutron-spacex-not-only-reason-building-rocket/cNGzWzzR99O"},{"title":"3 Growth Stocks With Earnings Growth Over 20%","summary":"The Strait of Hormuz closure has shaken global energy supply chains and pushed governments to rethink how and where future growth comes from. Capital is chasing companies that can grow earnings while keeping their balance sheets in good shape, because reliability has become a premium. This article looks at three stocks from a high quality growth screener and explains why these businesses score well on both potential and financial health. The three stocks highlighted here offer a compelling...","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-11-12T01:13:11Z","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/3-growth-stocks-earnings-growth-011311704.html"},{"title":"SpaceX CEO Elon Musk Says 100GW Of Solar Power In Space Could Match 800GW On Earth For Starmind","summary":"“100GW in space is roughly equal to 800GW on Earth,” Musk said in a post on X.","publisher":"Stocktwits","date":"2026-11-12T00:01:22Z","url":"https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/space-x-ceo-elon-musk-says-100-gw-of-solar-power-in-space-could-match-800-gw-on-earth-for-starmind/cNGzQ7yR99e"},{"title":"SpaceX (SPCX) Ordered Equipment For A 100 GW Solar Manufacturing Line","summary":"Space Exploration Technologies (NasdaqGS:SPCX) has ordered equipment for a 100 GW solar manufacturing line to support energy and satellite output. The group is planning a US$24b AI data center and gas fired power plant at its Starbase complex in Texas. SpaceX is one of eight companies selected for NASA contracts linked to a US$10b lunar base program focused on long term Moon infrastructure. These moves into 100 GW solar manufacturing, a US$24b AI power hub at Starbase and NASA lunar base...","publisher":"Simply Wall St.","date":"2026-11-11T23:19:46Z","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/energy/articles/spacex-spcx-ordered-equipment-100-231946867.html"},{"title":"Jim Cramer sends a strong signal on AT&T and SpaceX to investors","summary":"Jim Cramer sent a signal. Not everyone is hearing it the same way.","publisher":"TheStreet","date":"2026-11-11T22:33:00Z","url":"https://www.